(24, 'event', 'FÈ PASYON W POU FOTOGRAFI VIN YON KONPETANS PWOFESYONÈL ', '<p>F&Egrave; PASYON W POU FOTOGRAFI VIN YON KONPETANS PWOFESYON&Egrave;L&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>AutoFocus envite w enskri nan nouvo sesyon f&ograve;masyon li pou jwenn yon S&egrave;tifika nan Fotografi Nimerik, atrav&egrave; yon pwogram ki f&egrave;t pou akonpaye w soti nan nivo fondamantal rive nan nivo pwofesyon&egrave;l.</p>\r\n<p>Pandan f&ograve;masyon an, w ap aprann prensip esansy&egrave;l fotografi yo, teknik pou byen itilize kamera, jesyon limy&egrave;, kadraj, konpozisyon ak met&ograve;d pwofesyon&egrave;l pou pwodui imaj ki gen kalite gras ak seri pratik nou yo.</p>\r\n<p>⚠️ Staj Garanti 📸</p>\r\n<p>📅 Nouvo sesyon: 3 ak 4 okt&ograve;b 2026<br>🕚 Or&egrave;: Samdi ak dimanch, 11&egrave; AM pou 2&egrave; PM<br>💵 Fr&egrave; enskripsyon: 5 000 goud<br>📍 Adr&egrave;s: 34, Puits Blain 30, Delmas 75</p>\r\n<p>✅ Ranpli f&ograve;m sa a pou w enskri:</p>\r\n<p>https://forms.gle/nzzWexHrtbrgb9xY6</p>\r\n<p>📲 Antre nan gwoup WhatsApp la pou w resevwa plis enf&ograve;masyon:<br>https://chat.whatsapp.com/FGMG38BIZLwDWAWmPqG79N?s=cl&amp;p=i&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4</p>\r\n<p>📞 Enf&ograve;masyon: +509 3122-3337<br>📧 Im&egrave;l: konekteminfo@gmail.com</p>\r\n<p>Pa rete s&egrave;lman d&egrave;y&egrave; kamera a:&nbsp;<br>aprann metrize l, kreye imaj ki pale epi prepare t&egrave;t ou pou travay tankou yon pwofesyon&egrave;l.</p>\r\n<p>#AutoFocus&nbsp;<br>#PhotographieNum&eacute;rique #FormationProfessionnelle&nbsp;<br>#Photographie&nbsp;<br>#NouvelleSession</p>\r\n<p>#konektem&nbsp;<br>#toutkotenenp&ograve;tkil&egrave;</p>', '5000.00', 1, '2026-09-03 15:38:29', NULL),
(25, 'event', 'RENOUVEAU AP RIVE OKAP', '<p>&nbsp;RENOUVEAU AP RIVE OKAP</p>\r\n<p>Depi Renouveau soti, li deja f&egrave; yon b&egrave;l vwayaj&hellip;🌎</p>\r\n<p>Palais Municipal &mdash; Port-au-Prince&nbsp;<br>USA : Tampa &bull; Boston &bull; Fort Lauderdale<br>Canada : Montr&eacute;al &bull; Calgary<br>France</p>\r\n<p>E kounye a&hellip; se tou pa OKAP! 💃🏽🔥</p>\r\n<p>Apre tout vil sa yo, Barbara Cassamajor ap vin rankontre piblik Okap la pou yon nouvo vant-siyati alb&ograve;m &laquo; Renouveau &raquo;.</p>\r\n<p>📍 Nan Complexe Versailles, Okap<br>📅 20 septembre 2026</p>\r\n<p>Renouveau deja f&egrave; anpil chemen, men vwayaj la poko fini.✨</p>\r\n<p>Okap, &egrave;ske w pare pou w resevwa Renouveau??</p>\r\n<p>20 SEPTANM &mdash; COMPLEXE VERSAILLES.<br>RENOUVEAU RIVE LAKAY OU! 🎉</p>\r\n<p>#konektem<br>#toutkotenenp&ograve;tkil&egrave;</p>', '0.00', 1, '2026-09-03 15:42:38', NULL),
